                                                "sense_id": "50359156-181c-39f9-bbf5-cef1aed87d85",
                                                "text": "This message not only provides educated European Muslims with a political cause but is also pushed with considerable success at such international leftist jamborees as the World Social Forum, where the world’s antiglobalists meet."
